      "problem": "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\,$\n{{field-1}}",
